{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Welcome to Arcane Afterfall \u2013 a role-playing game inspired by the classics of the genre, where magic no longer reigns, and those who dream of restoring it must fight for their cause. This is a world where people from Earth arrived in search of the last drop of magical energy-only to discover new mysteries, ancient threats, and the struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/ac954e6ff6f66d9c5d64ff4fa0277050.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/ac954e6ff6f66d9c5d64ff4fa0277050.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/ac954e6ff6f66d9c5d64ff4fa0277050.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Explore a mysterious world filled with intrigue and unexpected encounters. Join secret organizations, solve riddles, and hunt for rare Easter eggs \ud83c\udfad hidden in the most unexpected places. Here, every choice has consequences, and knowledge is power \ud83d\udcd6\u2728.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL BATTLES AND DEADLY ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 The Arcane Afterfall combat system is designed for true strategists. Turn-based battles require a thoughtful approach-use unique abilities \u26a1, combine talents, analyze enemy weaknesses, and find vulnerabilities \ud83c\udfaf to gain the upper hand, even in the most challenging fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/e9448beb50b5b01e43d640f38f339a88.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/e9448beb50b5b01e43d640f38f339a88.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/e9448beb50b5b01e43d640f38f339a88.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 But the real trials await you in boss fights. Gigantic demons \ud83d\ude08, ancient artifact-bound entities \ud83d\udd2e, and mechanical titans \ud83e\udd16-each boss requires a unique strategy. Defeating them grants legendary rewards \ud83c\udfc6, but to triumph, you must rely not only on strength but also on cunning \ud83e\udde0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/6554c43aedaf56236266419991282c7c.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/6554c43aedaf56236266419991282c7c.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/6554c43aedaf56236266419991282c7c.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUNGEONS, PVP, AND THE &quot;TOWER OF ARCANA&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Venture into dark dungeons-alone or with a group. Every labyrinth holds its own secrets and deadly traps \u2620\ufe0f, and in its depths, powerful bosses and treasures \ud83d\udc8e await. For those who enjoy battling other players, PvP arenas are open, where you can test your skills in team fights \ud83c\udfc5. And in the Tower of Arcana, you\u2019ll start with no equipment and must find different ways to emerge victorious-only your skill determines the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD FULL OF MYSTERIES AND POSSIBILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Unravel the secrets of the nameless City by penetrating its Inside Out. Challenge the Shaved Sisters gang or become a paladin of the Last Order. Become a warrior of the Swamp Legion or set out to explore Zone 51 \ud83d\udc7d. Discover what lies hidden within the Confluxion and find your way through space and time in star sneakers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s always something to do in Arcane Afterfall - explore, fight, solve mysteries, and become part of a great story!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Bikers' Storm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/2a723a0c0d7ee8045fe6fe80a8642548a1d3596c.jpg"},{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/9bc63424eeb17791fe7d13c53f3bbfc78c9715db.jpg"},{"name":"Linguist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/911290adcc0d4bd2bf1fd8c7c9712d36c278ad2b.jpg"},{"name":"Flawless victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/21eb5157ebd2077a4a31fe7634f9b70386836cc0.jpg"},{"name":"Level 5 achieved","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/e38a7e02ccd9dcb4a553ff3c9630aebc1ae7bb9e.jpg"},{"name":"Kawaii won't pass!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/9ae79514f0a831f0e54552788c56236d8bf34d62.jpg"},{"name":"Proletarian anger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/ce698415e583ee124cad5901710020071372249e.jpg"},{"name":"The Echo of Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/f0dc9ab4348dafc999f60d35a3d661cad7e29757.jpg"},{"name":"Miser","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/3047adf461a282e05489e2e33b543ee0ee9d1d4d.jpg"},{"name":"Tomb raider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3220170/d8b4b75f0cf5503a7157c15b40fd636ceb361c20.jpg"}],"total":40},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220170?t=1769080675","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220170?t=1769080675","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/f8531ce0fb2ba172cd362b8a7f6b2f0e8aa233d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769080675","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/f8531ce0fb2ba172cd362b8a7f6b2f0e8aa233d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769080675","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>\u2728 Arcane Afterfall Update: Bug Fixes, Improvements &amp; Exciting Changes Ahead! \ud83d\udd2e</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Hey everyone! Thank you for your active feedback \u2013 we carefully read all your comments and suggestions, and it's because of you that Arcane Afterfall keeps getting better with every update!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2692\ufe0f What\u2019s new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- We\u2019ve fixed multiple bugs to make the game more stable and enjoyable for all players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Added a location map to help you more easily navigate the world that has lost its magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Faction restrictions in the Arcane Tower have been removed \u2013 groups are now formed solely based on player levels: 9-12, 13-16, 17-19, 20+. This change will help you take on challenges more easily</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- You can now discard unnecessary quest items if the associated quest is not in your journal \u2013 no more cluttered inventory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- System messages that previously might have appeared in the wrong language will now be displayed in the selected language.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 What\u2019s next?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re already working on new updates with exciting improvements and content. Stay tuned to be the first to know about upcoming changes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcac Share your thoughts, let us know what you love and what could be improved \u2013 your feedback truly matters to us!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Welcome to Arcane Afterfall \u2013 a role-playing game inspired by the classics of the genre, where magic no longer reigns, and those who dream of restoring it must fight for their cause. This is a world where people from Earth arrived in search of the last drop of magical energy-only to discover new mysteries, ancient threats, and the struggle for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/ac954e6ff6f66d9c5d64ff4fa0277050.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/ac954e6ff6f66d9c5d64ff4fa0277050.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/ac954e6ff6f66d9c5d64ff4fa0277050.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Explore a mysterious world filled with intrigue and unexpected encounters. Join secret organizations, solve riddles, and hunt for rare Easter eggs \ud83c\udfad hidden in the most unexpected places. Here, every choice has consequences, and knowledge is power \ud83d\udcd6\u2728.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TACTICAL BATTLES AND DEADLY ENEMIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 The Arcane Afterfall combat system is designed for true strategists. Turn-based battles require a thoughtful approach-use unique abilities \u26a1, combine talents, analyze enemy weaknesses, and find vulnerabilities \ud83c\udfaf to gain the upper hand, even in the most challenging fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/e9448beb50b5b01e43d640f38f339a88.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/e9448beb50b5b01e43d640f38f339a88.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/e9448beb50b5b01e43d640f38f339a88.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc79 But the real trials await you in boss fights. Gigantic demons \ud83d\ude08, ancient artifact-bound entities \ud83d\udd2e, and mechanical titans \ud83e\udd16-each boss requires a unique strategy. Defeating them grants legendary rewards \ud83c\udfc6, but to triumph, you must rely not only on strength but also on cunning \ud83e\udde0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/6554c43aedaf56236266419991282c7c.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/6554c43aedaf56236266419991282c7c.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/6554c43aedaf56236266419991282c7c.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DUNGEONS, PVP, AND THE &quot;TOWER OF ARCANA&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Venture into dark dungeons-alone or with a group. Every labyrinth holds its own secrets and deadly traps \u2620\ufe0f, and in its depths, powerful bosses and treasures \ud83d\udc8e await. For those who enjoy battling other players, PvP arenas are open, where you can test your skills in team fights \ud83c\udfc5. And in the Tower of Arcana, you\u2019ll start with no equipment and must find different ways to emerge victorious-only your skill determines the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/effa2338dca29c779aa227b825eb5dcd.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A WORLD FULL OF MYSTERIES AND POSSIBILITIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2e Unravel the secrets of the nameless City by penetrating its Inside Out. Challenge the Shaved Sisters gang or become a paladin of the Last Order. Become a warrior of the Swamp Legion or set out to explore Zone 51 \ud83d\udc7d. Discover what lies hidden within the Confluxion and find your way through space and time in star sneakers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.poster.avif?t=1769080675\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.webm?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/extras/13e8da8b28220d3a30401ad25034fc74.mp4?t=1769080675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There\u2019s always something to do in Arcane Afterfall - explore, fight, solve mysteries, and become part of a great story!</p>","developers":["Nokhook Entertainment"],"dlc":[3559700,3629240,3791310],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220170/088158bb604d56ba7912e1d27fdbfe28eac979f4/header.jpg?t=1769080675","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2048 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4096 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3220170/968817349/79c10ab96f82effd76a6c4298236da705b817653/1764585279/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764588714","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3220170/968817349/79c10ab96f82effd76a6c4298236da705b817653/1764585279/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764588714","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3220170/968817349/79c10ab96f82effd76a6c4298236da705b817653/1764585279/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764588714","id":257241349,"name":"Arcane Afterfall","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257241349/373c42c1295cec13e853af943691cb8f7d456fe5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764588714"}],"name":"Arcane Afterfall","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"m